'''Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger''' (操られしシルバーにゃんこ, ''Ayatsura reshi Shirubā Nyanko'', '''Possessed Silver Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. It was added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger
|image = E 775.png
|first appearance = [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 10|魅惑の堕天楼 - Floor 10]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
This unwilling villain attacks and moves very fast with dastardly [[Savage Blow|Savage Blows]], which may catch unsuspecting players off guard. Their damage is still quite pitiful, but they are surprisingly tanky, making them more of a support whose advance punishes you for failing to maintain the frontlines.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Fascinating Fallen Tower/Floor 10|Fascinating Fallen Tower Floor 10]] for strategies.''

